# The REBOL 3 interpreter used to check JEBOL's answers against a real one.
#
# A tool rather than source, and a 2.1M platform-specific binary at that.
# Fetch your own from the Oldes/Rebol3 releases, picking the build for your
# machine; see docs/allium-checker-notes.md for which asset and how to run
# it. The binaries linked from rebol.com are i386 and will not run on any
# current macOS.
/r3
/r3.exe

# Gradle
/.gradle/
/build/

# The Allium CLI's one-time notice marker, when the cache directory is not
# writable and it falls back to the project root.
/.allium-cli-notice-shown

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
